message: "If you use this repository or its datasets, please cite the associated publication."

title: "Pipeline Corpus: Cognitive Analysis of Gas Pipeline Discourse"

type: dataset

authors:
  - family-names: Frayne
    given-names: Craig
    alias: craigmateo

abstract: >
  A corpus of attributed quotations and source documents accompanying the
  article "Cognitive Analysis of Gas Pipeline Discourse." The repository
  contains article corpora, quotation datasets, and supporting materials
  used to compare cognitive framing across public discourse surrounding
  the Dakota Access Pipeline and Coastal GasLink Pipeline.

repository-code: "https://github.com/craigmateo/pipeline-corpus"

keywords:
  - corpus linguistics
  - discourse analysis
  - cognitive linguistics
  - environmental communication
  - pipeline discourse
  - Dakota Access Pipeline
  - Coastal GasLink
  - quotation corpus
  - ecolinguistics

